{"chapter": "etale", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "024L", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nUnramifiedness is a stalk local condition.\n\\end{slogan}", "MATH_0001": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$A$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathfrak q$", "MATH_0004": "$B$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathfrak p \\subset A$", "MATH_0006": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathfrak q$", "MATH_0008": "$A_{\\mathfrak p} \\to B_{\\mathfrak q}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-unramified-Noetherian}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:acec25a2d546b2c3e705498ea2d7eeeb0dba2a8d238a772addc8d5aeac77aa10", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1d570766ee7ecb944372f08f1637684284069aabcc53e8bc710d2c0725bf4278", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be of finite type with <MATH_0002> a Noetherian ring.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a prime of <MATH_0004> lying over <MATH_0005>.\nThen <MATH_0006> is unramified at <MATH_0007> if and only if\n<MATH_0008> is an unramified homomorphism\nof local rings.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c7245dff48c5d6b6600dc07aec2aa8c428db76aa3b079d8b615816175814c6e2", "unit_id": "tag:039G:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "024L", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d8993a3a70d0a777e81b1d21162c5a553e9c7282f1c1c434982a89113d2852cd", "source_text": "See discussion above.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:677861a71488f3c96ec96166b40373bac4c145d6f66caf6f9bad5244b6fac290", "unit_id": "tag:039G:proof"}
{"chapter": "etale", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "024L", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A$", "MATH_0002": "$A^\\wedge$", "MATH_0003": "$A$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-completion-Noetherian-Noetherian}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:053c0df41dac36144e1beecc626ca3a902e0c3db1b62ebb96a4780a86bf6a0b8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2fab0ddccb76044188e184f9e7d4045690e5858c143ece5a1d065c9270242c09", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe will characterize the property of being unramified in terms\nof completions. For a Noetherian local ring <MATH_0001>\nwe denote <MATH_0002> the completion of <MATH_0003> with respect to the\nmaximal ideal. It is also a Noetherian local ring, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e95b1884cc47aab56cf9c44d4c1787f8678759d5ab157d381f6ad419b2e7f700", "unit_id": "tag:024L:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "etale", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "024L", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0004": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0005": "$B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0006": "$A^\\wedge$", "MATH_0007": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0008": "$\\kappa(\\mathfrak m_A) = \\kappa(\\mathfrak m_B)$", "MATH_0009": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0010": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0011": "$\\kappa(\\mathfrak m_A)$", "MATH_0012": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0013": "$A$", "MATH_0014": "$B$", "MATH_0015": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0016": "$A$", "MATH_0017": "$B$", "MATH_0018": "$B$", "MATH_0019": "$A$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-unramified-completions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:71d994887e202ac1744878437c7e5462cb73732ab065f30ff426aab8138d8a39", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:46cc0c7d8e80b235af342185e979518eb083a6d7505257b949d9e9f4de9ed144", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> be Noetherian local rings.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a local homomorphism.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> if <MATH_0004> is an unramified homomorphism of local rings,\nthen <MATH_0005> is a finite <MATH_0006> module,\n<STRUCT_0003> if <MATH_0007> is an unramified homomorphism of local rings and\n<MATH_0008>,\nthen <MATH_0009> is surjective,\n<STRUCT_0004> if <MATH_0010> is an unramified homomorphism of local rings\nand <MATH_0011>\nis separably closed, then <MATH_0012> is surjective,\n<STRUCT_0005> if <MATH_0013> and <MATH_0014> are complete discrete valuation rings, then\n<MATH_0015> is an unramified homomorphism of local rings\nif and only if the uniformizer for <MATH_0016> maps to a uniformizer for <MATH_0017>,\nand the residue field extension is finite separable (and <MATH_0018> is\nessentially of finite type over <MATH_0019>).\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:672e2711cbe02584c01230514837749e75c1d97f8d64d1ebb3a79b176398b727", "unit_id": "tag:039H:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "024L", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\kappa(\\mathfrak m_A)$", "MATH_0002": "$B^\\wedge/\\mathfrak m_{A^\\wedge}B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0003": "$1$", "MATH_0004": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-finite-after-completion}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-NAK}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7266873c025f805d051f35dc321c136cec6639d2e2cb7548ea0cabdb61195850", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0a56591941d130686210e56c97256b7a4abd094362f4b570a20acb7398656fde", "source_text": "Part (1) is a special case of\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nFor part (2), note that the <MATH_0001>-vector space\n<MATH_0002>\nis generated by <MATH_0003>. Hence by Nakayama's lemma\n(Algebra, Lemma <REF_0002>) the map\n<MATH_0004> is surjective.\nPart (3) is a special case of part (2).\nPart (4) is immediate from the definitions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1a1192f3be9738475b91febcd526f021280351ad8441ae9f910948b58438b645", "unit_id": "tag:039H:proof"}
{"chapter": "etale", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "024L", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0004": "$B$", "MATH_0005": "$A$", "MATH_0006": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0007": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0008": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-unramified-completions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bb3bb77374509b3a6b9611d14360f6f04a6a653e3c20676c2b463d7be8a9f301", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bdc70fcca5f108cb8a79182ada8469860411e50145057c1fc955102c818ce419", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> be Noetherian local rings.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a local homomorphism such that <MATH_0004> is\nessentially of finite type over <MATH_0005>.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0006> is an unramified homomorphism of local rings\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0007> is an unramified homomorphism of local rings, and\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0008> is unramified.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:03625c5d4843fd9b99f7fa91e01c0337053cc746d623b9220fd8ce865354b130", "unit_id": "tag:039I:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "024L", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathfrak m_AA^\\wedge$", "MATH_0002": "$A^\\wedge$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$B \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0005": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathfrak m_AB^\\wedge = (\\mathfrak m_AB)B^\\wedge = \\mathfrak m_BB^\\wedge$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathfrak m_AB = \\mathfrak m_B$", "MATH_0008": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0009": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0010": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathfrak m_{B^\\wedge}$", "MATH_0012": "$B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0013": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0014": "$A^\\wedge \\to B^\\wedge$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-unramified-completions}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-characterize-unramified}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-unramified-at-prime}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0003": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0004": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:98a4b5789cdcefd3aebbf52374f9776931aa8af75c641223222ffdd89b2d6153", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c57af2886d8ff8792392456b0824825be52f58aedf66d2a96e6317084191ce0f", "source_text": "The equivalence of (1) and (2) follows from the fact that\n<MATH_0001> is the maximal ideal of <MATH_0002>\n(and similarly for <MATH_0003>) and faithful flatness of <MATH_0004>.\nFor example if <MATH_0005> is unramified, then\n<MATH_0006>\nand hence <MATH_0007>.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nAssume the equivalent conditions (1) and (2).\nBy Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe see that <MATH_0008> is\nfinite. Hence <MATH_0009> is of finite presentation, and by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002>\nwe conclude that <MATH_0010> is unramified at\n<MATH_0011>. Since <MATH_0012> is local we conclude\nthat <MATH_0013> is unramified.\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\nAssume (3). By Algebra, Lemma <REF_0003>\nwe conclude that <MATH_0014> is an unramified homomorphism\nof local rings, i.e., (2) holds.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fc9da4497e22899f92b4728eabf1da3de2590ff61213dc196e16887ff333e663", "unit_id": "tag:039I:proof"}
